<title>SINGAPORE: Malayan Credit buys sites for S$94.15 mln.</title>
<headline>Malayan Credit buys sites for S$94.15 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property group Malayan Credit Ltd (MCL) exercised an option on November 4 to buy five sites for a total of Singapore $94.15 million, a company statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>MCL said the sites, located in a prime residential district along Grange Garden, have a total area of 4,462.8 sq metres.</p>
<p>MCL plans to build a luxury block of apartments on the site.</p>
<p>($1 = S$1.40) -- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
